            time: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Asheviere%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_killer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Li'sar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Mother, I swore to end your reign of evil, and now I shall."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("Daughter, I built this kingdom for you. It has all been for you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-mad.webp",
            text: _("Even now, can you not tell the truth? Your greed has corrupted your soul. You are a monster! A murderess! It pains me to kill you, mother, but you have chosen your own fate. For Wesnoth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Li’sar strikes a killing blow!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Asheviere%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_killer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Konrad%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("You have hunted me across the countryside, indeed across the years. Here I am, Dark Queen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("I was sure I had killed you, yet you haunt me still. Be gone, demon! I banish you, ghost!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-human-mad.webp",
            text: _("Oh, wretched lady, I am very real. The land has suffered from your greed and ambition. You will now be held to account for your misdeeds. For the young Prince Konrad! For WESNOTH!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Konrad strikes a killing blow!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Asheviere%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_killer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Delfador%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("As I destroyed your son, I now destroy you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("You were always defiant, wizard, and no one has thwarted my plans as determinedly as you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I have always been a humble servant of the Crown, and remain such even now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("Delfador! You utterly disgust me, you sniveling worm. How dare you confront me, your queen?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("How dare I? I, High Provost of the Council of Archmagi..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("... bearer of the staff of An-Usrukhar, guardian of the Book of Crelanu ..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("... Mage Protector of The Kingdom Of The Peoples Of The West-North, Chief Advisor to the <i>Crown</i>..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("... and personal counselor to my King and my <i>friend</i>, Garard the Second, whom you most <i>foully</i> betrayed..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("I am Delfador the Great and TODAY YOU MEET YOUR ATONEMENT!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("In a horrific inferno of magical rage, Asheviere is completely annihilated!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "fire.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "lightning.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
